              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntibaze babicumbane n’umwambiro. Ndabibahaye, bibe umugabane wabo ku mashikanwa nshikanirwa atōngōrwa n’umuriro; n’ivyera cane, nk’ukw ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha kimeze, bo n’ic’ impongano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
