              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izinamuhungu wese wo muri bene Aroni yemererwa kubiryako; bibaye umwanya wabo w’intahava, ukw ibihe vy’urunganwe rwanyu bizogenda bikurikirana, wo ku mashikanwa nshikanirwa atōngōrwa n’umuriro; ūzobikorako wese azoba abaye uwera, abe inyegu yavyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.18",
